  ('making-something-with-your-hands', 365, 'Spend a quiet hour making anything that calls to you, and let your hands choose the materials.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 1, 'Set a timer for 20 minutes and work through one page of notes, then stop when it rings.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 2, 'Clear everything off your desk except what today''s subject needs, and notice how the space feels.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 3, 'Write down every assignment, quiz and exam you know about this term on one sheet of paper, so nothing lives only in your head.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 4, 'Close your notes and write three things you remember from your last class or lesson, then check what you missed.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 5, 'Put your phone in another room for one study session and see how much quieter your head feels.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 6, 'Pick the hardest task on your list and give it just the first five minutes before anything else.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 7, 'Explain one idea from your course out loud to an empty room, as if a friend had asked you about it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 8, 'Make five flashcards from today''s reading, with a question on the front and a short answer on the back.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 9, 'Take a ten-minute walk between two study sessions and leave your notes behind.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 10, 'Eat a real meal before you sit down to study tonight, not a handful of snacks at the desk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 11, 'Break one big assignment into five small steps and write the first one where you''ll see it tomorrow.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 12, 'Ask your teacher, instructor or a classmate one question you''ve been sitting on.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 13, 'Before bed, pack your bag for tomorrow so the morning has one less thing in it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 14, 'Take three slow breaths before you open your books, letting each exhale run a little longer than the inhale.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 15, 'Choose one spot that will be your study place this term and put a pen, paper and a water bottle there.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 16, 'Try one practice problem from the end of the chapter before you reread the chapter itself.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 17, 'Say one kind sentence to yourself after a hard quiz, the way you would to a friend who just took it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 18, 'Look at your calendar and mark the dates of your next two exams or deadlines in a bright color.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 19, 'Spend ten minutes on your commute, as a passenger on a bus or train, flipping through a few flashcards.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 20, 'Turn off notifications on your laptop for the length of one study block.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 21, 'Write the one question you most want answered in your next class at the top of a fresh page.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 22, 'Read a section, then close the book and summarize it in two sentences in your own words.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 23, 'Find out when your instructor holds office hours and put one visit on your calendar.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 24, 'Drink a full glass of water before you start studying and keep a refill within reach.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 25, 'Stand up, stretch your arms over your head and roll your shoulders after every half hour at the desk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 26, 'Tell one person in your life that you have a big test coming, so you''re not carrying it alone.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 27, 'Go back to notes from last week and quiz yourself on three points before learning anything new.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 28, 'Choose a stopping time for tonight''s studying before you begin, and keep it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 29, 'Sort your notes for one subject into a single folder, paper or digital, so they''re easy to find.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 30, 'Study for 25 minutes at the library today instead of at home, and notice whether the change helps.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 31, 'Write tomorrow''s three study tasks on a sticky note tonight and put it on your desk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 32, 'When you finish a chapter, do something small to mark it, like a favorite snack or a short walk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 33, 'Draw a quick sketch or diagram of one idea you''re learning, even if it''s rough.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 34, 'Put your study materials away at the end of the session so the table is yours again for the evening.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 35, 'Answer three questions from an old quiz or a practice set without looking at your notes first.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 36, 'Get to bed at a regular time tonight, since a rested brain tends to hold onto what you studied.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 37, 'Step outside for five minutes of fresh air before you start your homework or reading.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 38, 'Pick one topic you''ve been avoiding and write down exactly what about it feels hard.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 39, 'Say no to one extra plan this week during a busy exam season, and use that hour for rest or review.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 40, 'Teach one thing you learned today to a family member, roommate or friend in under two minutes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 41, 'Highlight less: on one page of reading, mark only the single most important sentence.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 42, 'Set your alarm a little earlier and spend fifteen quiet minutes reviewing before the day gets busy.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 43, 'Make a list of what you already understand well in one course, so you can see how far you''ve come.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 44, 'Before you open the exam, put both feet flat on the floor and take one slow breath.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 45, 'Rewrite one messy page of notes into a short, tidy summary you''d be glad to review later.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 46, 'Mix two different topics in one practice session instead of finishing one before starting the other.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 47, 'Swap a late-night study session for an early-morning one this once and see how it feels.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 48, 'Write down the worry that''s loudest about your next test, then write one small thing you can do about it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 49, 'Find a classmate or online learner who''s working on the same material and agree to check in once.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 50, 'Use a blank sheet to write everything you remember about one topic, then fill gaps from your notes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 51, 'Keep a snack that''s real food, like fruit or nuts, on hand for long study afternoons.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 52, 'Plan when you''ll review this week''s material again in a few days, and put it on your calendar.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 53, 'Listen to calm instrumental music, or nothing at all, during one session, and notice which helps more.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 54, 'Clean out your backpack or work bag, tossing old papers and finding the pens that actually work.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 55, 'After a disappointing grade, write one thing you''d keep doing and one thing you''d try differently.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 56, 'Read the instructions for your next assignment twice and underline exactly what it asks for.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 57, 'Close all browser tabs that aren''t for this study block before you begin.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 58, 'At lunch, review one short set of notes for ten minutes while you eat somewhere pleasant.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 59, 'Turn a heading in your textbook into a question, then read the section looking for the answer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 60, 'Pick a light, bright corner for studying today and open a window or blind if you can.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 61, 'Ask yourself what the teacher would most likely put on the test, and write down three guesses.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 62, 'Take a real break today: twenty minutes where you don''t read, scroll or study anything at all.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 63, 'Work through one problem slowly, writing each step and why you took it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 64, 'Notice one thing you did well in your studying this week and say it out loud.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 65, 'Lay out tomorrow''s clothes and anything you need for an early exam the night before.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 66, 'Write a short list of the formulas, dates or terms you keep forgetting and tape it near your desk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 67, 'Give yourself permission to study for just ten minutes today if that''s all you have.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 68, 'Sit somewhere outdoors with one set of notes for a short session in the fresh air.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 69, 'Look up one word or term from your course that you''ve been nodding along to without really knowing.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 70, 'Set a calm phone wallpaper or lock screen that reminds you to take a breath before you scroll.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 71, 'Make a simple checklist of what to bring on exam day: ID, pens, calculator, water.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 72, 'Join or start a study group for one course and suggest a short, focused first meeting.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 73, 'End today''s study session by writing one sentence about what you''ll start with next time.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 74, 'At the start of term, read through the syllabus or course outline once and note the three biggest deadlines.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 75, 'Buy or find one notebook just for the course you find hardest, so its notes don''t get lost among the others.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 76, 'Introduce yourself to one person in a class, course forum or study room before the term gets busy.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 77, 'Ask a librarian to show you where the quiet study rooms are, or how to book one.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 78, 'Write a short note to yourself about why you''re taking this class or learning this subject.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 79, 'Choose two regular times each week that will be your study hours, and treat them like appointments.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 80, 'Unpack your desk drawer and keep only what you''d use in a normal study session.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 81, 'Learn the name of one person who can help in your program, like a tutor, advisor or teaching assistant.'),
