  ('studying-without-the-stress', 130, 'Spend one lunch break somewhere green, and leave the books in your bag.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 131, 'Text a classmate and ask how they''re preparing for the next test.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 132, 'Write a short, honest list of what''s making studying feel heavy right now, then pick one thing to lighten.'),
