  ('studying-without-the-stress', 139, 'Take the stairs, stretch your legs or do a few squats when you feel restless while reading.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 140, 'Name three things you can see, hear and feel at your desk when your mind is racing before a test.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 141, 'Put your phone on do not disturb an hour before bed on the night before an exam.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 142, 'Write a kind note to the you who will take the exam, and tuck it in your bag.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 143, 'When you catch yourself saying "I''m bad at this," change it to "I''m still learning this."'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 144, 'Set out a glass of water, your pens and your ID tonight for tomorrow''s exam.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 145, 'Listen to one song you love at full attention after you finish a tough study block.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 146, 'Let yourself rest for a whole evening this week without feeling guilty about it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 147, 'As midterms approach, list every topic each exam covers and circle the two you know least.'),
