  ('studying-without-the-stress', 152, 'Pick the two hours of the day when you think most clearly and protect them for your hardest subject.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 153, 'Talk through a past quiz with a classmate and explain to each other why each answer is right.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 154, 'Stop studying an hour before bed tonight and do something slow, like a shower or a few pages of a novel.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 155, 'Remind yourself that feeling nervous before an exam is normal and means you care, then take a breath.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 156, 'Plan a lighter night during exam week, with no studying after dinner.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 157, 'Write a list of things you''re not doing during finals, like extra shifts or new projects, and let them wait.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 158, 'Read through your oldest notes for one course first, before newer material, so the early topics get their turn.'),
