  ('studying-without-the-stress', 172, 'Group your flashcards by theme and see which group still trips you up.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 173, 'Cover a diagram, redraw it from memory, then compare and fix it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 174, 'Write an answer to a likely essay question in bullet points, then talk it through out loud.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 175, 'Look for the main argument in each paragraph of a reading and write it in the margin in five words or fewer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 176, 'Pair up with a classmate and each write three questions for the other to answer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 177, 'Give yourself one study session with no notes allowed, only a blank page and what you remember.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 178, 'Choose a single chapter, read it slowly, and stop when you finish it, even if you have time left.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 179, 'Use a calm, clear desk light and close the curtains if outside noise or movement pulls you away.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 180, 'Remove one distraction from your study space today, like a TV remote, a game controller or a stack of mail.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 181, 'Wear headphones without music in a busy place to signal you''re focused and to soften the noise.'),
