  ('studying-without-the-stress', 185, 'Turn off autoplay on any video sites before you start an online lecture.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 186, 'During a long study day, step away from the screen every hour and look at something far away.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 187, 'Take a hot shower or a warm bath after a long day of studying to help your body relax.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 188, 'Listen to a short guided breathing track before you open a new set of practice problems.'),
