  ('studying-without-the-stress', 193, 'Take a moment after a tough test to notice one question you handled well.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 194, 'Write a short note of thanks to a classmate, tutor or teacher who helped you this term.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 195, 'Pick one thing you''ll do differently next term, and write it somewhere you''ll find it then.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 196, 'When finals end, put your notes in a box or folder and clear your desk for a fresh start.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 197, 'Read the feedback on one returned assignment closely and copy out one comment worth keeping.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 198, 'Ask your instructor where most points were lost on the last exam, so you know where to focus.'),
