  ('studying-without-the-stress', 205, 'Notice whether you''ve been skipping meals while studying, and plan a proper lunch for tomorrow.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 206, 'Take a short nap after lunch on a heavy study day if you feel foggy, and set an alarm for twenty minutes.'),
