  ('studying-without-the-stress', 208, 'Go to a fitness class, shoot some hoops or dance in your room between two study blocks.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 209, 'Call or text someone who makes you laugh during a stressful week of exams.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 210, 'Lie on the floor with your legs up the wall for five minutes after a long day at the desk.'),
