  ('studying-without-the-stress', 228, 'If you''re learning a language, label five things in your kitchen with sticky notes in that language.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 229, 'Read one short article about your subject over breakfast instead of scrolling the news.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 230, 'On a train or bus ride where you''re a passenger, read one section of notes and close your eyes to recall it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 231, 'Learn one new term in your field and use it in a sentence today.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 232, 'Write a short paragraph about how what you''re learning connects to your work or daily life.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 233, 'For a course you''re taking online, download the next lesson and watch it with notes, not as background.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 234, 'Pause an online lecture every ten minutes and jot down the main point before moving on.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 235, 'Join an online forum or group for people learning the same subject and read one helpful thread.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 236, 'Ask someone who already passed the exam or course what they wish they''d known.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 237, 'Pick a realistic study goal for a busy week, like three short sessions, and let that be enough.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 238, 'Over a school break, review one subject for twenty minutes so it doesn''t feel brand new next term.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 239, 'Spend a summer morning reading a book connected to something you''ll study in the fall.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 240, 'Keep a holiday study plan small: one short session a day, then let the rest of the day be for rest and people.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 241, 'Before winter break, write a note to future you about where you left off in each course.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 242, 'Enjoy one day of a school break with no studying at all, on purpose.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 243, 'During the summer, try one free online lesson in a subject you''re curious about.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 244, 'At the end of a vacation, spend one evening organizing your materials for the term ahead.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 245, 'Read for pleasure for twenty minutes today, any book you like, to remind yourself reading can be fun.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 246, 'Try studying at a park bench or on a porch for one session while the weather is nice.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 247, 'Pack a small study kit for travel: one notebook, a pen and a deck of flashcards.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 248, 'Find a library branch near work or home and visit it once just to see how it feels.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 249, 'Book a study room with a friend and agree on what each of you will finish before you leave.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 250, 'Bring your notes to a cafe with a classmate and quiz each other between sips.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 251, 'Choose a study buddy who stays calm and ask them to check in with you before the exam.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 252, 'Offer to explain a topic to a classmate who missed class, since teaching helps you learn it too.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 253, 'Divide a long reading among a study group and have each person teach their section.'),
