  ('studying-without-the-stress', 256, 'Ask a family member to listen while you explain a concept, even if they know nothing about it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 257, 'Share one study tip that works for you with a friend who''s also learning something.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 258, 'Leave a group chat on mute for the evening if it''s making you more anxious about the test.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 259, 'Go to a review session your instructor or school offers, and bring one question.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 260, 'Check whether your school or library has free tutoring, and write down how to book it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 261, 'Visit the writing center or a friend who writes well and ask for feedback on one paragraph.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 262, 'Find a classmate who understands a topic you don''t, and offer help with one they find hard.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 263, 'For a big paper, write a rough first sentence for each section before you write anything else.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 264, 'Start a research assignment by writing down three questions you want it to answer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 265, 'Write a messy first draft for fifteen minutes without stopping to fix anything.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 266, 'Read one paragraph of your essay out loud and smooth out any sentence that makes you stumble.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 267, 'Set a mini-deadline for each piece of a project two or three days before the real one.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 268, 'Schedule the next step of a long project on your calendar the moment you finish the current one.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 269, 'Check your citations for one source and fix the format before you forget where it came from.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 270, 'Put a big project''s due date and the steps leading up to it on a single page.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 271, 'Pick the smallest possible step on a task you''ve been putting off and do just that.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 272, 'Work on the hardest part of a problem set while you''re fresh, and leave the easy ones for later.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 273, 'Notice when you''re rereading the same line for the third time and take a two-minute break.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 274, 'Use a sand timer, kitchen timer or app to set one 30-minute block, then do nothing else until it''s up.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 275, 'Set up your study space the night before so tomorrow''s session can start right away.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 276, 'Light a candle, make tea or play soft music to signal to yourself that study time has begun.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 277, 'Keep your bed for sleep and do your studying somewhere else today.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 278, 'Give your eyes a rest by looking at something twenty feet away every twenty minutes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 279, 'Find a chair that supports your back, or add a cushion, before a long session.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 280, 'Open a window or step outside to breathe fresh air whenever the room starts to feel stuffy.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 281, 'Put a bowl of fruit or a healthy snack on the table before your study session starts.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 282, 'Tidy your study space for five minutes at the end of the day, so tomorrow begins calmly.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 283, 'Wipe down your desk and empty the trash bin near it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 284, 'Organize your pens, highlighters and sticky notes into one cup or box.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 285, 'Clear your computer desktop of old files and move them into course folders.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 286, 'Make one playlist of calm, wordless music to use only for studying.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 287, 'Hang a simple monthly calendar near your desk and fill in this month''s deadlines.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 288, 'Delete one app from your phone that pulls you away from studying most often.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 289, 'Ask yourself at the start of a session, "What does done look like today?" and write the answer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 290, 'Notice one moment today when learning felt interesting rather than like a chore.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 291, 'Celebrate turning in an assignment by taking a full evening off.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 292, 'Write a short list of reasons you''re proud of yourself for keeping at your studies.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 293, 'Wake up and drink a glass of water before you look at your study list.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 294, 'Do one gentle stretch and three slow breaths before you sit down to review in the morning.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 295, 'Go to sleep thirty minutes earlier tonight than you usually do during a heavy study stretch.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 296, 'Write tomorrow''s exam reminders on a sticky note and stick it to your door.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 297, 'Before a test, picture yourself walking in calmly, finding your seat and reading the first question.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 298, 'Choose a short phrase to repeat before an exam, like "I''ve prepared, and I can do this."'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 299, 'Breathe in for four counts and out for six, five times, while you wait outside the exam room.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 300, 'Wiggle your toes and press your feet into the floor if your nerves rise during a test.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 301, 'Write a brief list of what went right after an exam, before you think about what went wrong.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 302, 'Do something kind for your body after a stressful exam, like a long walk, a good meal or an early night.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 303, 'Make a list of three people you could ask for help if a course starts to feel like too much.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 304, 'Forgive yourself for one study plan that didn''t go the way you hoped, and make a smaller one.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 305, 'Put a note on your mirror that says "Learning takes time."'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 306, 'Take a few minutes to imagine the summer or break ahead and what you''ll enjoy doing.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 307, 'Turn off the TV and other screens in the room while you study tonight.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 308, 'Silence your phone and put it face down across the room for the length of one problem set.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 309, 'Use a website blocker for your two most distracting sites during your study hours.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 310, 'Write the word "later" on a slip of paper and use it to jot down tempting distractions instead of following them.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 311, 'Clear one surface in your home to be a phone-free study zone.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 312, 'Answer messages only during your study breaks, not in the middle of a session.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 313, 'Make a deal with yourself: five focused minutes, and then you can decide whether to keep going.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 314, 'Start a session by reviewing the last thing you studied, just for two minutes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 315, 'Study a confusing topic right after a short walk, when your mind feels fresher.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 316, 'Change rooms or seats after an hour of studying so your brain gets a small reset.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 317, 'Try studying the same material in two different places this week, to see which one helps you focus.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 318, 'Put your materials for a quiz in a clear folder so you can grab it on the way out the door.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 319, 'Prepare a short, easy dinner on Sunday to have on hand during a busy week.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 320, 'Plan your meals for the days around an exam so you''re not hungry and rushing.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 321, 'Bring a granola bar, nuts or fruit to a long exam if it''s allowed.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 322, 'Make your study breaks screen-free by stepping outside, stretching or making tea instead.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 323, 'Take a slow walk around the block after dinner before you start evening study.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 324, 'Spend five minutes on a puzzle, a doodle or a song after a long study block to give your mind a rest.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 325, 'Practice a short breathing exercise during study breaks for one day.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 326, 'Keep a jar on your desk and drop in a slip of paper each time you finish a task.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 327, 'Look back over this challenge so far and pick the one habit that helped you most.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 328, 'Write a letter to yourself to open after your next big exam, reminding yourself of your effort.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 329, 'Write one question about today''s lesson you''d like to explore further, just out of curiosity.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 330, 'Test yourself with a blank map, chart or diagram from your course and fill in what you can.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 331, 'Use colored pens to separate definitions, examples and questions in one set of notes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 332, 'Make a list of the steps for solving one type of problem and keep it beside you while you practice.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 333, 'Practice one kind of math or science problem until you can do it twice in a row without looking.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 334, 'Learn one tricky spelling or vocabulary word by writing it three times and using it in a sentence.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 335, 'Summarize an entire unit in ten bullet points on a single page.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 336, 'Rewrite one confusing paragraph from your notes as a simple question and answer.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 337, 'Note one example from your own life that matches an idea from your course.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 338, 'Explain a concept to yourself in the mirror, start to finish, without peeking at your notes.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 339, 'Read one page aloud slowly if a subject is hard to follow in silence.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 340, 'Find one gap in your notes and ask a classmate or check the textbook to fill it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 341, 'Quiz yourself on vocabulary while you brush your teeth or wait for the kettle.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 342, 'Cut a big chapter into three parts and read only the first part today.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 343, 'Choose one practice problem that scares you a little and give it an honest try.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 344, 'Write a list of questions you could ask at office hours, then pick the most useful one.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 345, 'Spend ten minutes before class reviewing your notes from the last session.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 346, 'Arrive at class or log on a few minutes early, and use that time to settle in.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 347, 'Sit near the front of the room for one class and see if it helps you pay attention.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 348, 'Write down the key point of a lecture in one sentence as soon as it ends.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 349, 'Check the course website or portal for any new announcements, so nothing catches you by surprise.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 350, 'Make a list of upcoming due dates for the next two weeks and post it near your desk.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 351, 'Plan one evening of exam week as fully free time, and write it on your calendar.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 352, 'Ask for an extension politely if something real has come up, rather than trying to push through without sleep.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 353, 'Turn down one invitation this week during a busy stretch, kindly and without long explanations.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 354, 'Pick one subject each evening to focus on, rather than switching among five.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 355, 'Spend five minutes reviewing a topic you''ve mastered, just to enjoy knowing it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 356, 'Ask yourself what part of today''s studying felt good, and plan to do more of that.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 357, 'Smile at the next page you open, even if it feels silly, and see whether it softens the moment.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 358, 'Hum, whistle or sing a few bars of a favorite song before a study session to loosen up.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 359, 'Share one thing you learned this week with someone you love, just because it''s interesting.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 360, 'Thank yourself out loud for each study session you showed up for lately, however short it was.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 361, 'Put away all your study materials for one evening and do something that has nothing to do with school.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 362, 'Picture where this learning could take you in a year, and let that picture carry you through today''s session.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 363, 'Write one sentence about what this challenge has taught you about how you study best.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 364, 'Pick one study habit from this challenge to keep going on your own, and write down when you''ll do it.'),
  ('studying-without-the-stress', 365, 'Close your books for the night, take a slow breath, and tell yourself you did enough today.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
